---
// 客服工作台（内部使用）：官网转人工客户的统一接待台
// 不进 SEO：noindex + robots.txt 排除
const SITE = 'Eternal CNC';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow,noarchive" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#99000D" />
    <title>客服工作台 · {SITE}</title>
    <style is:inline>
      *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
      :root{
        --bg:#F5F2ED;--panel:#fff;--line:#E5E1DA;--ink:#1E1A17;--muted:#6F6A63;
        --brand:#99000D;--brand-soft:#FDF1EF;--danger:#C4262E;--ok:#0E7A4F;--side:#1E1A17;
      }
      html,body{height:100%}
      body{
        font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI","PingFang SC","Hiragino Sans GB","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;
        background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow:hidden;
      }
      button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:none;color:inherit}
      input,textarea{font:inherit;outline:none}

      /* ---------- 登录 ---------- */
      #loginView{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:60;overflow-y:auto;background:var(--bg);
        display:flex;flex-direction:column;overscroll-behavior:contain}
      .login-top{flex:0 0 auto;background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
        border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:13px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;
        justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:2}
      .login-top img{height:28px;width:auto;display:block}
      .login-top a{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;transition:color .15s;
        white-space:nowrap}
      .login-top a:hover{color:var(--brand)}
      .login-body{flex:1 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
        padding:52px 20px 60px}
      .login-card{width:100%;max-width:400px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;
        padding:40px 34px 34px;text-align:center;
        box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(30,26,23,.04),0 14px 40px rgba(30,26,23,.07)}
      .login-card .brand{height:32px;width:auto;margin:0 auto 20px;display:block}
      .login-card h1{font-size:19px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--ink)}
      .login-card .sub{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:7px;line-height:1.6}
      .login-card .hint{font-size:11.5px;color:#8A847C;margin-top:16px;line-height:1.75;
        padding:10px 13px;background:#FAF8F4;border:1px solid #F0ECE5;border-radius:8px;text-align:left}
      .login-card label{display:block;text-align:left;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);
        margin:22px 0 7px;font-weight:500}
      .login-card input{width:100%;padding:11px 13px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;
        font-size:14.5px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);
        transition:border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s}
      .login-card input::placeholder{color:#B4AEA6}
      .login-card input:focus{border-color:var(--brand);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(153,0,13,.08)}
      .login-card button{width:100%;margin-top:14px;padding:12px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--brand);
        color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:14.5px;letter-spacing:.02em;
        transition:background .15s,opacity .15s}
      .login-card button:hover{background:#7D000B}
      .login-card button:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default}
      .err{margin-top:12px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--danger);min-height:16px;text-align:left}
      .login-foot{flex:0 0 auto;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;
        padding:22px 22px 26px}
      .login-foot .inner{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;
        gap:8px 26px;justify-content:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#8A847C;line-height:1.9}
      .login-foot b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
      .login-foot .cp{width:100%;text-align:center;color:#B4AEA6;font-size:11px;margin-top:8px}

      /* ---------- 主界面 ---------- */
      .app{height:100%;display:flex}
      #sidebar{width:330px;flex:0 0 330px;background:var(--side);color:#e2e8f0;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
      .side-head{padding:16px 16px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
        border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
      .side-title{font-size:14.5px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.01em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
      .badge{background:var(--danger);color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:9px;
        line-height:16px;min-width:18px;text-align:center}
      .ghost{font-size:12.5px;color:#94a3b8;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:7px;transition:all .15s}
      .ghost:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);color:#fff}
      .list{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain}
      .item{padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);cursor:pointer;
        transition:background .12s;position:relative}
      .item:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.05)}
      .item.on{background:rgba(153,0,13,.32)}
      .item-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px}
      .item-name{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:#f1f5f9;flex:1;overflow:hidden;
        text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
      .item-time{font-size:11px;color:#64748b;flex:0 0 auto}
      .item-msg{font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;line-height:1.5;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;
        display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;word-break:break-word}
      .item-tags{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
      .tag{font-size:10.5px;padding:1.5px 6px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);color:#cbd5e1}
      .tag.wait{background:rgba(217,45,32,.18);color:#fca5a5}
      .tag.done{background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);color:#64748b}
      .tag.lang{background:rgba(153,0,13,.28);color:#F2B8B3}
      .dot{position:absolute;right:14px;bottom:14px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--danger)}
      .list-empty{padding:40px 20px;text-align:center;color:#64748b;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7}
      .me-name{font-size:11.5px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:3px}
      .side-tools{display:flex;gap:2px;align-items:center}
      .ghost.on{background:rgba(153,0,13,.42);color:#FBE0DD}

      #main{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;background:var(--bg)}
      .empty{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
        color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;gap:10px}
      .empty svg{opacity:.35}

      .chat{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0}
      .chat-head{padding:12px 18px;background:var(--panel);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
        display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:0 0 auto}
      .back{display:none;font-size:22px;line-height:1;color:var(--brand);padding:0 6px 2px}
      .chat-title{flex:1;min-width:0}
      .chat-title strong{font-size:14.5px;display:block;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
      .chat-title .meta{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted)}
      .code{font-size:11.5px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;background:#f2f4f7;
        color:#475467;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;flex:0 0 auto}
      .profile-bar{padding:9px 18px;background:#fbfcfd;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;
        gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);flex:0 0 auto}
      .profile-bar b{color:#344054;font-weight:600}
      .profile-bar .k{color:#98a2b3}

      .messages{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:20px 18px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;
        overscroll-behavior:contain}
      .row{display:flex}
      .row.me{justify-content:flex-end}
      .bubble{max-width:min(76%,620px);padding:9px 13px;border-radius:13px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.6;
        word-break:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(16,24,40,.06)}
      .row.them .bubble{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom-left-radius:5px}
      .row.me .bubble{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;border-bottom-right-radius:5px}
      .bubble .who{font-size:10.5px;opacity:.7;margin-bottom:3px;display:block}
      /* AI 助手回复：虚线边框，和人工回复一眼区分 */
      .row.them .bubble.ai{background:#f8fafc;border-style:dashed;border-color:#cbd5e1}
      .stamp{font-size:10.5px;color:#98a2b3;margin-top:4px;text-align:right}
      .row.them .stamp{text-align:left}
      .msgs-empty{margin:auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center;line-height:1.8}

      .composer{padding:10px 14px calc(10px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));background:var(--panel);
        border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-end;flex:0 0 auto}
      .composer textarea{flex:1;resize:none;max-height:130px;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius:10px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5;background:#fcfcfd;transition:border-color .15s}
      .composer textarea:focus{border-color:var(--brand);background:#fff}
      .composer button{padding:10px 18px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--brand);color:#fff;font-weight:600;
        font-size:13.5px;flex:0 0 auto;transition:opacity .15s}
      .composer button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}
      .ended-note{padding:12px 14px;background:#fffbeb;border-top:1px solid #fde68a;color:#92400e;
        font-size:12.5px;text-align:center;flex:0 0 auto}

      @media(max-width:900px){
        #sidebar{width:100%;flex:1 1 100%}
        #main{display:none}
        .app.detail #sidebar{display:none}
        .app.detail #main{display:flex}
        .back{display:block}
        .bubble{max-width:84%}
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- 登录 -->
    <div id="loginView">
      <div class="login-top">
        <img src="/images/logo-full.svg" alt={SITE} />
        <a href="/">← 返回官网</a>
      </div>
      <div class="login-body">
        <form id="loginForm" class="login-card" autocomplete="off">
          <img class="brand" src="/images/logo-full.svg" alt={SITE} />
          <h1>客服工作台</h1>
          <p class="sub">{SITE} 国际官网 · 在线接待台</p>
          <p class="hint">仅限市场部坐席使用。默认口令为本人手机号后 6 位；忘记或无法登录请联系管理员。回复客户时会记录坐席姓名，便于事后追溯。</p>
          <label for="passcode">坐席口令</label>
          <input id="passcode" type="password" placeholder="请输入你的坐席口令" autocomplete="current-password" />
          <button type="submit" id="loginBtn">进入工作台</button>
          <p id="loginErr" class="err"></p>
        </form>
      </div>
      <div class="login-foot">
        <div class="inner">
          <span>工作时间 <b>周一至周六 08:30–18:00</b></span>
          <span>客服热线 <b>181 2398 3352</b></span>
          <span>邮箱 <b>sales@eternalcnc.com</b></span>
          <div class="cp">© 2026 鑫永恒（深圳）精密实业有限公司 · 内部系统，请勿外传</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 主界面 -->
    <div id="appView" class="app" hidden>
      <aside id="sidebar">
        <header class="side-head">
          <div>
            <div class="side-title">客户会话 <span id="unreadBadge" class="badge" hidden>0</span></div>
            <div id="meName" class="me-name"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="side-tools">
            <button id="soundBtn" class="ghost" title="新消息提示音">🔔</button>
            <button id="notifyBtn" class="ghost" title="桌面通知">📢</button>
            <button id="logoutBtn" class="ghost">退出</button>
          </div>
        </header>
        <div id="sessionList" class="list"></div>
      </aside>

      <main id="main">
        <div id="emptyState" class="empty">
          <svg width="46" height="46" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-9 8.4 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.1A8.4 8.4 0 0 1 12.5 3a8.4 8.4 0 0 1 8.5 8.5z" />
          </svg>
          <p>从左侧选择一个客户开始接待</p>
        </div>

        <div id="chatView" class="chat" hidden>
          <header class="chat-head">
            <button id="backBtn" class="back" aria-label="返回">‹</button>
            <div class="chat-title">
              <strong id="chatTitle">客户</strong>
              <span id="chatMeta" class="meta"></span>
            </div>
            <span id="chatCode" class="code"></span>
          </header>
          <div id="profileBar" class="profile-bar"></div>
          <div id="messages" class="messages"></div>
          <form id="replyForm" class="composer">
            <textarea id="replyText" rows="1" placeholder="输入回复，Enter 发送，Shift+Enter 换行"></textarea>
            <button type="submit" id="sendBtn">发送</button>
          </form>
          <div id="endedNote" class="ended-note" hidden>该会话已结束，客户可能已离开。如需继续沟通请让客户重新发起。</div>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>

    <script is:inline>
      (function () {
        var state = {
          authed: false,
          sessions: [],
          currentUid: null,
          current: null,
          listTimer: null,
          chatTimer: null,
          sending: false,
          lastMsgSig: '',
        };

        var $ = function (id) { return document.getElementById(id); };

        function api(path, opts) {
          return fetch(path, Object.assign({ credentials: 'same-origin' }, opts || {})).then(function (r) {
            return r.json().catch(function () { return null; }).then(function (d) {
              return { status: r.status, data: d };
            });
          });
        }

        function fmtTime(ts) {
          if (!ts) return '';
          var diff = Date.now() - ts;
          if (diff < 0) return '刚刚';
          if (diff < 60000) return '刚刚';
          if (diff < 3600000) return Math.floor(diff / 60000) + ' 分钟前';
          if (diff < 86400000) return Math.floor(diff / 3600000) + ' 小时前';
          var d = new Date(ts);
          var md = (d.getMonth() + 1) + '/' + d.getDate();
          return md + ' ' + ('0' + d.getHours()).slice(-2) + ':' + ('0' + d.getMinutes()).slice(-2);
        }

        function esc(s) {
          return String(s == null ? '' : s)
            .replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;')
            .replace(/"/g, '&quot;').replace(/'/g, '&#39;');
        }

        /* ---------------- 新消息提醒：声音 + 桌面通知 ---------------- */
        // 声音用 WebAudio 现场合成，不依赖任何音频文件；浏览器要求先有用户手势才能播放，
        // 所以任意点击/按键都会尝试解锁 AudioContext。
        var actx = null;
        var flashTimer = null;
        var flashOn = false;

        function unlockAudio() {
          try {
            var AC = window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext;
            if (!AC) return;
            if (!actx) actx = new AC();
            if (actx.state === 'suspended') actx.resume();
          } catch (e) {}
        }

        function beep() {
          if (!state.soundOn) return;
          try {
            unlockAudio();
            if (!actx) return;
            var t = actx.currentTime;
            [660, 990].forEach(function (f, i) {
              var o = actx.createOscillator();
              var g = actx.createGain();
              var t0 = t + i * 0.17;
              o.type = 'sine';
              o.frequency.setValueAtTime(f, t0);
              g.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, t0);
              g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.32, t0 + 0.02);
              g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, t0 + 0.15);
              o.connect(g);
              g.connect(actx.destination);
              o.start(t0);
              o.stop(t0 + 0.17);
            });
          } catch (e) {}
        }

        function flashTitle(text) {
          if (flashTimer) return;
          flashOn = false;
          flashTimer = setInterval(function () {
            flashOn = !flashOn;
            document.title = flashOn ? '● ' + text : BASE_TITLE;
          }, 1000);
        }

        function stopFlash() {
          if (flashTimer) { clearInterval(flashTimer); flashTimer = null; }
          document.title = BASE_TITLE;
        }

        function notifyIncoming(list) {
          beep();
          var body =
            list.length === 1
              ? (list[0].company || '访客') + '：' + String(list[0].last_customer_msg || '发来新消息').slice(0, 60)
              : list.length + ' 个客户发来新消息';
          if (document.hidden) {
            flashTitle('新消息');
            if (state.notifyOn && window.Notification && Notification.permission === 'granted') {
              try {
                var n = new Notification('客服工作台 · 新消息', { body: body, tag: 'agent-new' });
                n.onclick = function () { try { window.focus(); } catch (e) {} n.close(); };
              } catch (e) {}
            }
          } else {
            document.title = '● 新消息 · ' + body.slice(0, 24);
            setTimeout(function () {
              if (!document.hidden && !flashTimer) document.title = BASE_TITLE;
            }, 4000);
          }
        }

        function refreshToggles() {
          $('soundBtn').textContent = state.soundOn ? '🔔' : '🔕';
          $('soundBtn').className = 'ghost' + (state.soundOn ? ' on' : '');
          $('notifyBtn').textContent = state.notifyOn ? '📢' : '📴';
          $('notifyBtn').className = 'ghost' + (state.notifyOn ? ' on' : '');
        }

        $('soundBtn').addEventListener('click', function () {
          state.soundOn = !state.soundOn;
          try { localStorage.setItem('agent_sound', state.soundOn ? '1' : '0'); } catch (e) {}
          refreshToggles();
          if (state.soundOn) beep();
        });

        $('notifyBtn').addEventListener('click', function () {
          if (!('Notification' in window)) { alert('当前浏览器不支持桌面通知'); return; }
          if (Notification.permission === 'granted') {
            state.notifyOn = !state.notifyOn;
            try { localStorage.setItem('agent_notify', state.notifyOn ? '1' : '0'); } catch (e) {}
            refreshToggles();
            return;
          }
          if (Notification.permission === 'denied') {
            alert('通知权限已被拒绝。请点地址栏左侧的锁图标 → 通知 → 允许，然后刷新页面。');
            return;
          }
          Notification.requestPermission().then(function (p) {
            state.notifyOn = p === 'granted';
            try { localStorage.setItem('agent_notify', state.notifyOn ? '1' : '0'); } catch (e) {}
            refreshToggles();
          });
        });

        document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', function () {
          if (!document.hidden) stopFlash();
        });
        document.addEventListener('click', unlockAudio, true);
        document.addEventListener('keydown', unlockAudio, true);
        refreshToggles();

        /* ---------------- 登录 ---------------- */
        function showLogin(msg) {
          $('appView').hidden = true;
          $('loginView').style.display = 'flex';
          if (msg) $('loginErr').textContent = msg;
          setTimeout(function () { $('passcode').focus(); }, 60);
        }

        function showApp() {
          $('loginView').style.display = 'none';
          $('appView').hidden = false;
          $('meName').textContent = state.me ? '当前坐席：' + state.me : '';
          refreshList();
          startListPolling();
        }

        $('loginForm').addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
          e.preventDefault();
          var code = $('passcode').value.trim();
          if (!code) return;
          $('loginBtn').disabled = true;
          $('loginErr').textContent = '';
          api('/api/agent/login', {
            method: 'POST',
            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
            body: JSON.stringify({ passcode: code }),
          }).then(function (r) {
            $('loginBtn').disabled = false;
            if (r.status === 200 && r.data && r.data.ok) {
              $('passcode').value = '';
              state.authed = true;
              state.me = r.data.name || '';
              state.prevReady = false;
              state.prevCustomerAt = {};
              showApp();
            } else {
              $('loginErr').textContent = (r.data && r.data.msg) || '登录失败，请重试';
            }
          }).catch(function () {
            $('loginBtn').disabled = false;
            $('loginErr').textContent = '网络错误，请重试';
          });
        });

        $('logoutBtn').addEventListener('click', function () {
          api('/api/agent/login', { method: 'DELETE' }).then(function () {
            state.authed = false;
            stopPolling();
            showLogin('');
          });
        });

        /* ---------------- 会话列表 ---------------- */
        function startListPolling() {
          if (state.listTimer) clearInterval(state.listTimer);
          state.listTimer = setInterval(refreshList, 3000);
        }

        function refreshList() {
          if (!state.authed) return;
          api('/api/agent/sessions').then(function (r) {
            if (r.status === 401) { state.authed = false; stopPolling(); showLogin('登录已过期，请重新登录'); return; }
            if (!r.data || !r.data.ok) return;
            state.sessions = r.data.sessions || [];
            // 新客户消息检测：只看客户消息时间（last_customer_at），自己刚发的回复不会触发提醒
            var map = {};
            var incoming = [];
            var ready = state.prevReady;
            state.sessions.forEach(function (s) {
              if (!s.active) return;
              var t = s.last_customer_at || 0;
              map[s.uid] = t;
              if (ready && t > (state.prevCustomerAt[s.uid] || 0)) incoming.push(s);
            });
            state.prevCustomerAt = map;
            state.prevReady = true;
            if (incoming.length) notifyIncoming(incoming);
            renderList();
            var ub = $('unreadBadge');
            if (r.data.unread > 0) { ub.hidden = false; ub.textContent = String(r.data.unread); }
            else { ub.hidden = true; }
          }).catch(function () { /* 静默重试 */ });
        }

        function renderList() {
          var box = $('sessionList');
          if (!state.sessions.length) {
            box.innerHTML = '<div class="list-empty">暂无客户会话<br/>客户在官网点「转人工」后会出现在这里</div>';
            return;
          }
          var html = '';
          state.sessions.forEach(function (s) {
            var name = s.company || (s.uid.indexOf('user_') === 0 ? '访客 ' + s.uid.slice(5, 13) : '访客 ' + s.uid.slice(0, 10));
            var tags = '';
            if (!s.active) tags += '<span class="tag done">已结束</span>';
            else if (s.unread) tags += '<span class="tag wait">待回复</span>';
            if (s.language) tags += '<span class="tag lang">' + esc(String(s.language).toUpperCase()) + '</span>';
            if (s.parts && s.parts.length) tags += '<span class="tag">' + esc(s.parts[0]) + '</span>';
            html +=
              '<div class="item' + (s.uid === state.currentUid ? ' on' : '') + '" data-uid="' + esc(s.uid) + '">' +
                '<div class="item-top">' +
                  '<span class="item-name">' + esc(name) + '</span>' +
                  '<span class="item-time">' + esc(fmtTime(s.last_activity)) + '</span>' +
                '</div>' +
                '<div class="item-msg">' + esc(s.last_customer_msg || '（暂无消息内容）') + '</div>' +
                (tags ? '<div class="item-tags">' + tags + '</div>' : '') +
                (s.active && s.unread ? '<span class="dot"></span>' : '') +
              '</div>';
          });
          box.innerHTML = html;
          Array.prototype.forEach.call(box.querySelectorAll('.item'), function (el) {
            el.addEventListener('click', function () { openSession(el.getAttribute('data-uid')); });
          });
        }

        /* ---------------- 会话详情 ---------------- */
        function openSession(uid) {
          if (state.currentUid === uid) {
            document.getElementById('appView').classList.add('detail');
            return;
          }
          state.currentUid = uid;
          state.current = null;
          state.lastMsgSig = '';
          document.getElementById('appView').classList.add('detail');
          $('emptyState').hidden = true;
          $('chatView').hidden = false;
          $('messages').innerHTML = '<div class="msgs-empty">加载中…</div>';
          renderList();
          loadSession();
          api('/api/agent/session?uid=' + encodeURIComponent(uid), { method: 'POST' }).catch(function () {});
          if (state.chatTimer) clearInterval(state.chatTimer);
          state.chatTimer = setInterval(loadSession, 3000);
        }

        function loadSession() {
          var uid = state.currentUid;
          if (!uid) return;
          api('/api/agent/session?uid=' + encodeURIComponent(uid)).then(function (r) {
            if (r.status === 401) { state.authed = false; stopPolling(); showLogin('登录已过期，请重新登录'); return; }
            if (!r.data || !r.data.ok) {
              if (r.status === 404) {
                $('messages').innerHTML = '<div class="msgs-empty">该会话已不存在</div>';
              }
              return;
            }
            if (uid !== state.currentUid) return;
            state.current = r.data;
            renderSession();
          }).catch(function () { /* 静默重试 */ });
        }

        function renderSession() {
          var s = state.current;
          if (!s) return;
          var p = s.customer || {};
          var name = p.company || ('访客 ' + s.uid.slice(0, 12));
          $('chatTitle').textContent = name;
          var metaBits = [];
          if (p.industry) metaBits.push(p.industry);
          if (p.quote_status) metaBits.push('报价：' + p.quote_status);
          if (!s.active) metaBits.push('已结束');
          else metaBits.push('进行中');
          $('chatMeta').textContent = metaBits.join(' · ');
          $('chatCode').textContent = s.code || '';

          var pb = [];
          if (p.company) pb.push('<span><span class="k">公司</span> <b>' + esc(p.company) + '</b></span>');
          if (p.language) pb.push('<span><span class="k">语言</span> <b>' + esc(String(p.language).toUpperCase()) + '</b></span>');
          if (p.parts && p.parts.length) pb.push('<span><span class="k">关注</span> <b>' + esc(p.parts.join('、')) + '</b></span>');
          if (p.contact_email) pb.push('<span><span class="k">邮箱</span> <b>' + esc(p.contact_email) + '</b></span>');
          pb.push('<span><span class="k">访客ID</span> <b>' + esc(s.uid) + '</b></span>');
          $('profileBar').innerHTML = pb.join('');
          $('profileBar').hidden = false;

          var tl = s.timeline || [];
          var sig = tl.length + '|' + (tl.length ? tl[tl.length - 1].at : 0);
          if (sig === state.lastMsgSig) {
            // 内容没变，不重绘，避免打断阅读
          } else {
            state.lastMsgSig = sig;
            renderMessages(tl);
          }

          if (!s.active) {
            $('endedNote').hidden = false;
            $('replyForm').style.display = 'none';
          } else {
            $('endedNote').hidden = true;
            $('replyForm').style.display = 'flex';
          }
        }

        function renderMessages(tl) {
          var box = $('messages');
          if (!tl.length) {
            box.innerHTML = '<div class="msgs-empty">暂无对话记录<br/>客户在官网发来的消息会显示在这里</div>';
            return;
          }
          var atBottom = box.scrollHeight - box.scrollTop - box.clientHeight < 80;
          var html = '';
          tl.forEach(function (m) {
            var me = m.role === 'agent';
            var isAi = me && m.via === 'ai';
            var who = '';
            if (me) {
              if (isAi) who = 'AI 助手';
              else if (m.via === 'wecom') who = (m.staff || '客服') + ' · 企微';
              else who = m.staff || '客服';
            }
            html +=
              '<div class="row ' + (me ? 'me' : 'them') + '">' +
                '<div class="bubble' + (isAi ? ' ai' : '') + '">' +
                  (who ? '<span class="who">' + esc(who) + '</span>' : '') +
                  esc(m.content) +
                  '<div class="stamp">' + esc(fmtTime(m.at)) + '</div>' +
                '</div>' +
              '</div>';
          });
          box.innerHTML = html;
          if (atBottom) box.scrollTop = box.scrollHeight;
        }

        /* ---------------- 发送 ---------------- */
        var ta = $('replyText');
        ta.addEventListener('input', function () {
          ta.style.height = 'auto';
          ta.style.height = Math.min(ta.scrollHeight, 130) + 'px';
        });
        ta.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
          if (e.key === 'Enter' && !e.shiftKey) {
            e.preventDefault();
            $('replyForm').requestSubmit();
          }
        });

        $('replyForm').addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
          e.preventDefault();
          if (state.sending) return;
          var text = ta.value.trim();
          var uid = state.currentUid;
          if (!text || !uid) return;
          state.sending = true;
          $('sendBtn').disabled = true;
          api('/api/agent/reply', {
            method: 'POST',
            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
            body: JSON.stringify({ uid: uid, text: text }),
          }).then(function (r) {
            state.sending = false;
            $('sendBtn').disabled = false;
            if (r.status === 200 && r.data && r.data.ok) {
              ta.value = '';
              ta.style.height = 'auto';
              state.lastMsgSig = '';
              loadSession();
              refreshList();
            } else {
              alert((r.data && r.data.msg) || '发送失败，请重试');
            }
          }).catch(function () {
            state.sending = false;
            $('sendBtn').disabled = false;
            alert('网络错误，请重试');
          });
        });

        $('backBtn').addEventListener('click', function () {
          document.getElementById('appView').classList.remove('detail');
          state.currentUid = null;
          state.current = null;
          if (state.chatTimer) { clearInterval(state.chatTimer); state.chatTimer = null; }
          $('chatView').hidden = true;
          $('emptyState').hidden = false;
          renderList();
        });

        function stopPolling() {
          if (state.listTimer) { clearInterval(state.listTimer); state.listTimer = null; }
          if (state.chatTimer) { clearInterval(state.chatTimer); state.chatTimer = null; }
        }

        /* ---------------- 启动 ---------------- */
        api('/api/agent/login').then(function (r) {
          if (r.data && r.data.authed) {
            state.authed = true;
            state.me = r.data.name || '';
            showApp();
          } else if (r.data && r.data.configured === false) {
            showLogin('工作台尚未启用：请在 Cloudflare 配置 AGENT_PASSCODE');
          } else {
            showLogin('');
          }
        }).catch(function () { showLogin(''); });
      })();
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
